id: pm-jira-native-backend-conformance
title: Certify Jira workflows on filesystem and a native non-filesystem backend
description: Roadmap acceptance requires native backend conformance beyond the delivered filesystem binding. Depends on the native SDK context and upstream conformance/migration contracts.
type: Feature
status: open
priority: 2
tags[3]: sdk-gap,"upstream:pm-cli#1588","upstream:pm-cli#1589"
