author: codex-astra
acceptance_criteria: "Run identical synthetic import/export/reconcile scenarios on filesystem and a native backend with no tracker directory; Verify custom fields, body, status, references, complete-read refusal, deterministic replay, interruption/resume, concurrent writers and local edits, unsupported capability refusal, and CLI/SDK parity with real SDK calls and OS processes; Record migration fidelity and precise supported surfaces without whole-package parity claims"
